<title>UK: Wuerttemberg Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttemberg Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Trinkaus and Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    12.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.26     PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	LISTING    STUT	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    0.08	SELL CONC   0.22</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 836</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
